OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FDry
OL,6,Fearly Thursday, breezy with rain in
OL,7,Fthe afternoon. Mostly dry with sunny
OL,8,Fspells on Friday. Turning breezing
OL,9,Fwith rain Saturday afternoon.
OL,10,FTemperatures around average for early
OL,11,FSeptember.
